xdg-desktop-portal-wlr (0.8.1-1ppa1~ubuntu26.04.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Cherry-pick upstream fixes for screencast on PipeWire 1.6.x (fixes
    single-window sharing crashing with "no more output formats"):
  * d/p/pipewire-1.6-fix-framerate-negotiation.patch: skip maxFramerate
    and guard division when framerate == 0 (upstream 896cee82, in
    0.8.2).
  * d/p/pipewire-1.6-readable-mappable-buffers.patch: set
    READABLE/MAPPABLE buffer flags to avoid client segfaults (upstream
    45983137, in 0.8.2).

 -- Paolo Gentili <paolo@pgentili.com>  Fri, 03 Jul 2026 14:26:20 +0200

